# System information commands and the self-tests from the shell.
$ version
~ ^BeeCodersOs \d+\.\d+\.\d+ b\d+ - x86_64 kernel in Rust$
filesystem: BeeFS on RAM disk
$ mem
~ ^heap: \d+ KiB used of \d+ KiB$
$ df
~ ^ramdisk: \d+ KiB used, \d+ KiB free, 4096 KiB total; \d+ of \d+ inodes free$
$ selftest
~ ^selftest: \d+ passed, 0 failed$
!~ FAIL
$ history
~ ^\s+1\s+version$
~ ^\s+5\s+history$
$ ask hello
no AI bridge: this machine has no second serial port (COM2)
$ ai
bridge:      none (no COM2 port in this machine)
$ slots
not booted from a boot disk with A/B slots (see tools/bootdisk.py)
